{"line_num": "120", "sentence": "I was finally diagnosed March 16th after 3 years of trying to get help thinking I was going crazy.", "uuid": "301b191c-1f9f-4c3a-95f0-fc04910e6766"}
{"line_num": "121", "sentence": "I\u2019m really angry that a neurologist dismissed me years ago claiming I was flunking the cognitive tests on purpose for attention.", "uuid": "301b191c-1f9f-4c3a-95f0-fc04910e6766"}
{"line_num": "122", "sentence": "Fast forward and now I\u2019m moderately effective with this nasty disease.", "uuid": "301b191c-1f9f-4c3a-95f0-fc04910e6766"}
{"line_num": "123", "sentence": "So many emotions", "uuid": "301b191c-1f9f-4c3a-95f0-fc04910e6766"}
{"line_num": "124", "sentence": "My name is Vickie B.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "125", "sentence": "I turn 50 in 4 days, and I've been living with younger onset Alzheimer\u2019s since 2021.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "126", "sentence": "Have I cried? Yep- a few short times.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "127", "sentence": "BUT I have made it my mission to not stay/live in my sadness.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "128", "sentence": "I choose daily to see and find beauty and joy around me.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "129", "sentence": "And if I have a bad day, I give myself some grace.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "130", "sentence": "Honestly, because of the outlook I've chosen, my life has been better and more fulfilling then pre-diagnosis.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "131", "sentence": "I share this in the hopes that other like me can shift their mindset.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "132", "sentence": "And it's not just my mindset that's changed.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "133", "sentence": "I exercise like I should have been doing for the past 20+ years.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "134", "sentence": "Daily walks, regular cardio and strength training at a gym, and a complete diet overload have radically improved how I feel, my moods, and my sleep quality.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "135", "sentence": "I'm also active with the Alzheimer\u2019s Association and fundraise for them.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "136", "sentence": "They've given me a platform to share my story, struggles, and positivity- I speak about my journey publicly as often as I can.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "137", "sentence": "Finally, for full transparency, this past winter was awful for me.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "138", "sentence": "There were days I could barely get out of bed.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "139", "sentence": "I slept 9-10 hours at night and would nap during the day.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "140", "sentence": "I had a hard time motivating myself to even eat, not to mention prepare a full meal.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "141", "sentence": "It was rough, It was scary, and I hated feeling like that.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "142", "sentence": "I'm not all sunshine and rainbows- but I am fighting for my life each and every day.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "143", "sentence": "Here's to hoping we can lift one another up and inspire a continued fight.", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "144", "sentence": "\ud83d\udc9c", "uuid": "de808a2a-47f1-4156-abe5-30c58bcf26f2"}
{"line_num": "145", "sentence": "I am 77, newly diagnosed with MCI and my doctor is recommending Leqembi.", "uuid": "d3080981-2e27-4983-b6f3-b3a9e87bd3dd"}
{"line_num": "146", "sentence": "Would like to know if anyone has experience with starting on Kinsua and then moving onto Leqembi ?? Thanks", "uuid": "d3080981-2e27-4983-b6f3-b3a9e87bd3dd"}
{"line_num": "147", "sentence": "I am now 57 and was diagnosed officially earlier this year.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "148", "sentence": "The doctors had an idea a few years ago, but after suffering the first Covid in 2020, they were unable to tell what cognitive impairment from the virus compared to dementia due to Alzheimer's disease.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "149", "sentence": "I had a 3-hour cognitive eval, the doctors agreed to wait to see if things improved.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "150", "sentence": "Meanwhile, I had to resign from a 35-year legal career due to cognitive decline, slow brain processing.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "151", "sentence": "I have always had ALZ in my genetic testing, I knew what side it is on.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "152", "sentence": "I just never imagined it would happen this soon.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "153", "sentence": "Thankful for the knowledge of my docs and the fact that they didn't give up.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "154", "sentence": "The PET scan was amazing to show what areas of the brain the plaques are in.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "155", "sentence": "I will be starting Leqembi, I had to have the Watchman implanted to get off of blood thinners first.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "156", "sentence": "I have not yet been able to speak to anyone who is on it.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "157", "sentence": "I am curious about how it makes you feel, have you noticed any clarity compared to how you were feeling before? I will be sure to post after I start so I can give people a little insight.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "158", "sentence": "Meanwhile, I love Pilates, I have exercised since I was a teenager.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "159", "sentence": "I love to volunteer, and we have fostered animals for years.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "160", "sentence": "I love scary movies, since I was a kid.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "161", "sentence": "I have a list of at least 50 things I need to accomplish in the house, but it depends on the day whether my brain will focus enough for me to complete tasks and how many tasks.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "162", "sentence": "This is not just forgetting why I walked into a room.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "163", "sentence": "This is more complex with the brain, but I am aware that it is happening.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "164", "sentence": "One of the kids bought me a book called A Question A Day.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "165", "sentence": "I am determined to get through it to give back to her before I'm unable to finish it.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "166", "sentence": "Currently, what I am struggling with the most is telling anyone other than my family about the diagnosis.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "167", "sentence": "It was a lot to go to each of our children and tell them.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "168", "sentence": "I have not worked up to telling anyone else we know.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "169", "sentence": "As a matter of fact, I have been more distant from all of our friends.", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "170", "sentence": "How did everyone else tell people what they are going through? Did you wait a while or tell people immediately? Thank you!", "uuid": "bb77f4ce-1eb6-4b45-827d-d42ea2814079"}
{"line_num": "171", "sentence": "Hi! I am 56 years old, and I received my early-onset ALZ diagnosis two weeks ago.", "uuid": "13ed7c52-9bd9-42c9-b3c1-67a30851e7a7"}
{"line_num": "172", "sentence": "I had a positive Amyloid & Tau PET scan.", "uuid": "13ed7c52-9bd9-42c9-b3c1-67a30851e7a7"}
{"line_num": "173", "sentence": "I'm waiting for my APOE test to come back to decide whether I can or will move forward with donanemab treatment.", "uuid": "13ed7c52-9bd9-42c9-b3c1-67a30851e7a7"}
{"line_num": "174", "sentence": "I'm very emotional, sad & scared of the side effects and my future", "uuid": "13ed7c52-9bd9-42c9-b3c1-67a30851e7a7"}
{"line_num": "175", "sentence": "I have been very emotional, ugly crying today.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "176", "sentence": "Today is hard, others are not- those days I am \"numb\".", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "177", "sentence": "I am 41, married for 19 years, I have 5 kids ages 8, 10, 17, 18, 20.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "178", "sentence": "I have tested positive for PSEN1 which is one of 3 variants known to cause young onset Alzheimer\u2019s.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "179", "sentence": "I have had cognitive symptoms since August 2023.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "180", "sentence": "I spoke with a genetic counselor 1 week ago.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "181", "sentence": "Because my specific variant is so rare (Ala409Thr) it is hard to know for certain my prognosis.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "182", "sentence": "Listed as \"likely\" pathogenic.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "183", "sentence": "At this time, they think it is either autosomal dominant, de novo (sporadic) young onset Alzheimer\u2019s, or Logopenic primary progressive aphasia (LvPPA) which is also a form of Alzheimer\u2019s.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "184", "sentence": "To say this is devastating is an understatement.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "185", "sentence": "I am in an incredibly fragile state right now.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "186", "sentence": "For the past 1 year I have seen at least 8 specialists (had 3 brain MRI's, 2 spine MRI's, lumbar puncture testing for MS, loads of blood work, cardic 14 day monitor, EKG, vestibular VNG testing, audiology testing, functional EEG, neuropsychiatic testing for memory loss) to figure out why I have been having first language decline, memory decline, depth perception changes, vertigo etc.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "187", "sentence": "We ruled out MS, vestibular migraines, inner ear, sleep apnea, etc.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "188", "sentence": "I was also diagnosed with long covid that has resulted in ME/CFS (chronic fatigue syndrome) and POT (postural orthostatic tachycardic syndrome) but also based on my PSEN1 gene variant I now also have early onset Alzheimer\u2019s.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "189", "sentence": "I know the prognosis is not good and being young (41) increases my chances of a more rapid and aggressive decline.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "190", "sentence": "I am the primary earner and we are in a whirlwind of emotions.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "191", "sentence": "Still haven't told our kids yet and we know we have a lot to talk about and plan but it's so difficult to also \"accept\" this is our new reality.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "192", "sentence": "It's hard to find a therapist that has any knowledge of this type of disease.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "193", "sentence": "I hate to only vent to my husband.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "194", "sentence": "I came here because it helps to be around people that understand what I am going through and read their stories.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "195", "sentence": "It is hard not to wallow in my depression, but I know I need to get outside, absorb some sunshine and start eating better.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "196", "sentence": "I hope to take much overdue family trips, take photos, make videos, write letters to my kids over the next few years.", "uuid": "6caf8f84-89b1-40da-9098-08ac1d4257d6"}
{"line_num": "197", "sentence": "Hello, I was diagnosed with early onset Alzheimer's in October at the age of 49.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "198", "sentence": "I've had the the test and it does show I have one variance of the APOE/4 gene and the only kind of Alzheimer's we have my family is on my mom's side and they were diagnosed in their middle to late '70s.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "199", "sentence": "This is just been a shock I knew something was wrong but I just thought I was getting old.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "200", "sentence": "My career for the past 25 years has been IT services and analyzing and the last job I had this summer or tried to get I got fired because I couldn't complete a certification for the first time in my life.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "201", "sentence": "I have to say this is extremely humbling and I think I'd rather have cancer.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "202", "sentence": "Right now Im going to speech therapy and physical therapy and doctor's appointments and dealing with disability.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "203", "sentence": "I'm allowed to drive locally and on the highways with no interstate but they let me know that I usually isn't long before they I fail the test, I won't be able to drive it all.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "204", "sentence": "This just isn't what I thought my life would be and I'm just trying to catch up with it all.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "205", "sentence": "I thought I had a lot of time but I was diagnosed with the 4-8 year prognosis.", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "206", "sentence": "Jen", "uuid": "6af92036-dc6d-4805-ba01-a9bfed991aff"}
{"line_num": "207", "sentence": "First post, so forgive me for any missteps.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "208", "sentence": "My DW (61) was diagnosed with Alzheimers earlier this year, but symptoms have been present for about 3 years.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "209", "sentence": "Our major issue seems to be communication......it always seems to be confrontational.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "210", "sentence": "She feels I do not have any patience (somewhat true) and I feel she constantly criticizes, insults and bitches at me.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "211", "sentence": "She is currently taking Quetiapine for anger issues which has helped somewhat.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "212", "sentence": "I have made direct requests for her to curtail this behavior with no success.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "213", "sentence": "She feels I always change her requests or desires.", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "214", "sentence": "Any suggestions on how to address this?", "uuid": "8a24617d-e499-42c2-93ef-4777f3137c3f"}
{"line_num": "215", "sentence": "It took forever to accept this diagnosis.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "216", "sentence": "My family has always held me to very high standards.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "217", "sentence": "Along with the diagnosis they all stopped contacting me.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "218", "sentence": "I have begged anyone even my husband to come talk to my doctor during my appointments.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "219", "sentence": "They all tell me this is my problem.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "220", "sentence": "My doctor thinks I need to find alternative support.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "221", "sentence": "I have no idea where to begin and I am so scared of what the future holds for me now.", "uuid": "5e9ad277-1aa8-4298-90bb-512d6ed1fc80"}
{"line_num": "222", "sentence": "I have a neurocognitive disorder and I'm waiting for my neuropsych testing so I can be diagnosed.", "uuid": "63f09bef-21f8-4e53-919b-c3175c44d673"}
{"line_num": "223", "sentence": "This is very challenging and I was seeing if there is anyone out there who has or is going through this.", "uuid": "63f09bef-21f8-4e53-919b-c3175c44d673"}
{"line_num": "224", "sentence": "Any advice or stories would be great.", "uuid": "63f09bef-21f8-4e53-919b-c3175c44d673"}
{"line_num": "225", "sentence": "I was recently diagnosed with AD after having MCI for the past 5 years.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "226", "sentence": "My neurologist is recommending that I start a monoclonal antibody treatment regimen and has suggested Liqembi.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "227", "sentence": "As I do my own research, it looks like Kisunla is considerably more effective.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "228", "sentence": "It more aggressively removes existing plaque while preventing new buildup and does not require continuous treatments once the plaque is cleared.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "229", "sentence": "I also see a lot of people on these threads receiving Liqembi.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "230", "sentence": "It could just be that Liqembi was available first and Kisunla was only available beginning last year.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "231", "sentence": "From what you all have learned and experienced on your journeys, is there something I'm missing that indicates I should be considering Liqembi instead of Kisunla? Was it a battle for you all to get your insurance to cover treatments? My first inquiry came back that my provider does not cover either treatment.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "232", "sentence": "After digging on my own I found a statement from them that if my doctor provides a page worth of different test results and validations, they will agree to cover it.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "233", "sentence": "I'm wondering if they will try to deny coverage at every juncture.", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "234", "sentence": "Thanks for your insight!", "uuid": "dd948ad6-9da6-463a-af9d-f9c5fff46bc5"}
{"line_num": "235", "sentence": "Hello friends- I am newly diagnosed Early Onset.", "uuid": "8781f16f-2d9c-4ca4-a257-54efeecf3f7c"}
{"line_num": "236", "sentence": "I'm looking for support groups, counselors or therapists/social workers who can offer support in this stage.", "uuid": "8781f16f-2d9c-4ca4-a257-54efeecf3f7c"}
{"line_num": "237", "sentence": "I am in my early 50s, still working, kids in college, mortgage, mom with Alz.", "uuid": "8781f16f-2d9c-4ca4-a257-54efeecf3f7c"}
{"line_num": "238", "sentence": "I need help and a place to be able to talk about what this means for my life.", "uuid": "8781f16f-2d9c-4ca4-a257-54efeecf3f7c"}
{"line_num": "239", "sentence": "Like, seriously?? Can't I bargain and offer to get this when I'm 70 please?! If there is anyone near Houston, I'd love to meet up.", "uuid": "8781f16f-2d9c-4ca4-a257-54efeecf3f7c"}
